    <TD align="left" valign="top" colspan="4" height="115"><b>Raised in the war torn area around Kelethin, Cryotek soon found himself engaging in combat on a daily basis, this combined with a natural gift for startegy and tatics led him to the warriors guild...but something was missing. After a short stint in the rigid confines of a soldier's life he soon longed for something else, something...broader. Late one evening he visited the home of the bards, entranced by the music he heard coming form within he decided to have a look inside, what he saw would change his life forever and set him on the path he still follows to this day. Inside were all manner of bards, wood elves, half elves and even a spattering of humans engaged in a rousing good time, challenging each other with their songs and having a rousing good time drinking and carousing with each other. Right then and there, he decided to devote his life to the music and to being the best bard in all of Norrath. The rest, as they say, is histoty...</b></TD>
